{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（18日）重陽節，當局預計昨日起的重陽節3日連假會出現人流高峰，經新皇崗口岸過關人次每日逾10萬。</p><p>保安局「口岸通」網站顯示，截至下午2時，出境大堂內繁忙，香港居民平均須輪候30分鐘，訪港旅客平均輪候約45分鐘。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T06:38:54.074220+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T06:21:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T06:37:34.919204+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T06:37:34.919204+00:00","content_hash":"3886eb988c3b6629f0d3d08ea696f40c025a80fd9b52bbf3a4c0a68247e3b4fb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}